# Re-record: vhs docs/assets/demo.tape (from the repo root)
Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1340
Set Height 430
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "# /ai:next runs this script: ranked open work from GitHub issues + roadmap"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "bash bin/ai-kit-next.sh --limit 4"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
